  [
    id 68
    label "TIgI6VWxPto"
    step 0
    date "2014-08-02T06:36:03Z"
    title "How to Draw a Cartoon Mouse"
    description "An easy way to draw a simple cartoon mouse in under 2 minutes.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Have a go and tell me how you did.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Join me on Facebook and tell me if you have tried this drawing.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Start by drawing a circle with a straight line extending off the top in the shape of a number 6.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Draw two large semi circles for ears.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Continue with a larger curved line for the mouses body, this is like a large backwards number 6.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Add three small round paws and a horizontal line ending in three smaller round paws. The front leg and paws are smaller than the back.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Continue with a line to the mouse's nose. Colour the mouse's nose and eye. Add three whiskers on each side of the nose and a long &amp;#34;S&amp;#34; shaped tail.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;SUBSCRIBE for more art videos, Drawing and painting tutorials http://www.youtube.com/subscription_center?add_user=shaunryanart &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Say hi to me on Facebook http://www.facebook.com/shaunryanart &amp;#10;&amp;#10;WEBSITE: http://www.shaunryan.co.nz"
