    step 0
    date "2020-12-09T17:00:11Z"
    title "How To Draw HANDS"
    description "This video is all about drawing hands.  I cover basic forms, things to avoid, tips and tricks, and shadowing and detail.  Hands have so much movement and expression that it's impossible to cover everything in one video, but I hope this overview helps you with your own hand drawing!Thanks for watching!  If you enjoyed this video, please share the link, and don't forget to subscribe to keep up to date on future content. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Check out my new website at https://www.davidfinchart.com where you can find my Drawing Superhero Heads full length course, broken down into lessons, and also a list of free drawing resources.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow me on Instagram at https://www.instagram.com/dfinchartist/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Join my Discord to keep up on livestream updates and other news. https://discord.gg/XUbstjx&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;https://www.indiegogo.com/projects/david-finch-s-exclusive-red-sonja-cover#/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Batman Catwoman exclusive cover:  https://www.shop.comicsketchart.com/David-Finch-Exclusive-Variants_c402.htm&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow Uri Montiero, my new super talented video editor, on Instagram!https://www.instagram.com/uri.motion/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;High resolution images from this video can be found here:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;https://gum.co/JkMnD&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;My Current List of Tools&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Links below are affiliate links.  If you make a purchase through an affiliate link I'll get a commission.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/2MooC46 tombow fudenosuke brush pen hard&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/3dvG6aR staedler lead holder&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/3cvNrFZ pentel arts brush &amp;#10;https://amzn.to/3eOwSqq sakura pigma micron 01&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/2MoBfwd faber castell kneaded eraser&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/2Xwr9Q6 2h lead&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/305Jzc1 strathmore 200 series bristol paper&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/36XgBg5 lead pointer&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/3gQtmgN uni posca white pens"
