    description "Colorsheet can be downloaded at:&amp;#10;http://dearingdraws.com/downloadstore/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The Seed of Life Mandala pattern is created by seven overlapping circles in a symmetrical formation. It is believed by some that the symbol of the seven circles represent the 6 days of creation en the seventh day of rest.&amp;#10;One of the basic polygon forms and techniques that are used to draw sacred geometric patterns in general.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9998; &amp;#9998; &amp;#9998; My Coloring Book  &amp;#9998; &amp;#9998; &amp;#9998;:&amp;#10;https://dearingdraws.com/wandering-minds-coloring-book/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;My Website&amp;#10;https://dearingdraws.com/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;FaceBook&amp;#10;http://www.facebook.com/dearingdraws&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Instagram&amp;#10;http://instagram.com/dearing_draws&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Some of the Tools and Materials that I use:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Books:&amp;#10;http://amzn.to/1xAF1T6&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Tools and Materials:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Staedler Drawing 5 Set Advanced Compass: &amp;#10;http://amzn.to/1FdIf2R&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Faber Castell TK Fine Vario Pencil 0.5 MM&amp;#10;http://amzn.to/1ML43bN&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Triangle Rotring Ruler &amp;#10;http://amzn.to/1ML4i6I&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Black Marker&amp;#10;http://amzn.to/1wcCd3j&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Derwent Paper Size A3 /16.5 x 11.75 inch&amp;#10;http://amzn.to/17I7DTd&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Micron pens&amp;#10;http://amzn.to/1AxnXAy&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Caran D'Ache Pablo Color Pencils&amp;#10;http://amzn.to/1wcAtXY&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Rotring Fineliner pen set 0.3/ 0.5/ 0.7mm&amp;#10;http://amzn.to/19WgpPd"
