    title "How to Draw a Nose - EASY"
    description "How to draw a nose step by step for beginners. Learn how to create a variety of nose shapes using this method!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Requested by: Wendy Nelson :)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128276; SUBSCRIBE for more FREE drawing tutorials: https://www.youtube.com/user/RapidFireArt?sub_confimation=1&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9989; RELATED TUTORIALS&amp;#10;How to draw a nose from the side: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cxspC_lJqkk&amp;#10;How to draw noses from the 3/4 view: http://rapidfireart.com/2016/09/27/how-to-draw-a-nose-from-the-34-view/&amp;#10;How to draw a nose on a face: http://rapidfireart.com/2015/12/07/how-to-draw-a-face-in-8-steps/&amp;#10;How to shade: http://rapidfireart.com/2016/07/19/how-to-shade-the-ultimate-tutorial/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9999;&amp;#65039;&amp;#10084;&amp;#65039; TOOLS I USED&amp;#10;- Canson Sketch Paper: https://amzn.to/2Wlij87&amp;#10;- Derwent Graphic Pencils: https://amzn.to/2GPXme7&amp;#10;- 4B Mechanical Pencil Lead: https://amzn.to/2EpZx56&amp;#10;- Kneadable Eraser: https://amzn.to/2M5tVYV&amp;#10;- Blending Stump: https://amzn.to/2wcMobn&amp;#10;- Transparent Ruler&amp;#10;- Soft Tissue Paper: https://amzn.to/2JYkjwr&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9200; SKIP TO TIMESTAMP &amp;#9200;&amp;#10;Intro: 0:00&amp;#10;Preliminary Guidelines Pt 1: 0:10&amp;#10;Drawing Noses on a Face: 2:18&amp;#10;Preliminary Guidelines Pt 2: 4:18&amp;#10;Shading: 6:26&amp;#10;Blending: 11:43&amp;#10;Lifting Highlights! (my fav part): 14:24&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128226; If you enjoyed this video, help others enjoy it by adding captions in your native language. Thank you! - http://www.youtube.com/timedtext_video?ref=share&amp;#38;v=DeFv3pg_Fxk&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128085; RFA STORE:&amp;#10;https://teespring.com/stores/rapidfireart&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;FOLLOW ME HERE:&amp;#10;Website: www.rapidfireart.com&amp;#10;Facebook: www.facebook.com/RapidFireArtTutorials&amp;#10;&amp;#10;CREDIT&amp;#10;Intro by RavenProDesign&amp;#10;you