    title "FRUITS (BUAH-BUAHAN) - COMPLETE edition - How to Draw and Color for Kids - CoconanaTV"
    description "Let's learn to draw FRUITS.&amp;#10;This video invites all kids to draw and color FRUITS with Coconana.&amp;#10;Including:&amp;#10;- Apple.&amp;#10;- Strawberry.&amp;#10;- Orange.&amp;#10;- Mango.&amp;#10;- Cherry.&amp;#10;- Grape.&amp;#10;- Pineapple.&amp;#10;- Banana.&amp;#10;- Mangosteen.&amp;#10;- Watermelon.&amp;#10;- Star fruit.&amp;#10;- Water apple.&amp;#10;- Papaya.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;All of you can learn how to draw in this video, line by line and also how to color.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Also, don't forget to like and subscribe!&amp;#10;Happy drawing!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;By Coconana&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Mari belajar konsep menggambar BUAH-BUAHAN.&amp;#10;Seperti berikut ini:&amp;#10;- Apel.&amp;#10;- Stroberi.&amp;#10;- Jeruk.&amp;#10;- Mangga.&amp;#10;- Ceri.&amp;#10;- Anggur.&amp;#10;- Nanas.&amp;#10;- Pisang.&amp;#10;- Manggis.&amp;#10;- Semangka.&amp;#10;- Belimbing.&amp;#10;- Jambu air.&amp;#10;- Pepaya.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Video ini mengajak adik-adik untuk menggambar BUAH-BUAHAN.&amp;#10;adik-adik dapat mencontoh cara menggambar di video ini, garis demi garis dan juga cara untuk mewarnai.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Jangan lupa untuk like dan subscribe!&amp;#10;Selamat menggambar!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Oleh Coconana.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;How to DRAW and COLOR  (cara menggambar dan mewarnai) Playlist - &amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLrddgQn0g0zZCh58hZ3T0IiMWJKqzEQA3&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Popular NURSERY RHYMES (lagu populer untuk anak-anak) Playlist - &amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLrddgQn0g0zbhWIbmzbE9XAiWhYcgIbxU&amp;#10;&amp;#10;How to draw FRUITS (cara menggambar dan mewarnai BUAH) Playlist - &amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLrddgQn0g0zYRKTOtZVA35-JQ_3WGy-Eq&amp;#10;&amp;#10;How to draw DINOSAUR (cara menggambar dan mewarnai DINOSAURUS) Playlist - &amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLrddgQn0g0zay6w33nb1uTIXATSWtgeHB&amp;#10;&amp;#10;How to draw ANIMAL (cara menggambar dan mewarnai HEWAN) Playlist - &amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLrddgQn0g0zYlEXJ8-5j-oZJiDVDNx64G&amp;#10;&amp;#10;How to draw SCENERY (cara menggambar dan mewarnai PEMANDANGAN) Playlist - &amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLrddgQn0g0zYrCbJM0a28Tqq982RSQ4Ps&amp;#10;&amp;#10;How to Draw VEGETABLES (menggambar dan mewarnai SAYURAN) Playlist -&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLrddgQn0g0zZJqsubajYlxvlvHSzbeuaa&amp;#10;&amp;#10;How to Draw FLOWERS (menggambar dan mewarnai BUNGA) Playlist -&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLrddgQn0g0zaiXVKKpQK5WH0zPuphH0q1&amp;#10;&amp;#10;How to draw and color COMPILATION (KOMPILASI cara menggambar dan mewarnai) Playlist - &amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLrddgQn0g0zZxtxjomxug7ePFKQJHIsmE&amp;#10;&amp;#10;COCONANA COMPILATION series (seri KOMPILASI COCONANA) Playlist - &amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLrddgQn0g0zbjGgSXT3Pmu2BbtSB_t8IT&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Like and follow us on Facebook &amp;#10;https://www.facebook.com/Coconanatv/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Visit our website&amp;#10;https://www.coconanatv.com/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;For business inquiries: coconanaentertainment@gmail.com&amp;#10;#fruits #howtodraw #kids #kidsshow #coconana"
